Real APIs often depend on databases, external services, and other components. Managing these dependencies is crucial for reliable tests.

**Dependency Types and Strategies**:

| Dependency | Testing Strategy | Example |
|------------|------------------|---------|
| **Database** | Test database, transactions | PostgreSQL test instance |
| **External API** | Mock or stub | nock, wiremock |
| **File system** | Temporary files | tmp, mock-fs |
| **Time** | Mock time | sinon.useFakeTimers |
| **Email/SMS** | Mock service | Mailhog, test SMS service |

