**Key Insight**: API chain testing ensures that complex workflows work end-to-end. Each step should be tested both in isolation and as part of the chain.

Microservices introduce unique integration challenges. Services must communicate correctly over the network, handle failures, and maintain data consistency.

**Microservices Communication Patterns**:

| Pattern | Description | Testing Approach |
|---------|-------------|------------------|
| **REST/Sync** | Direct HTTP calls | Test endpoints, timeouts, retries |
| **Message Queue** | Async events | Test message publishing/consumption |
| **gRPC** | High-performance RPC | Test proto contracts, streaming |
| **GraphQL** | Unified API layer | Test resolvers, data fetching |
| **Service Mesh** | Sidecar proxy | Test circuit breakers, retries |

