**Key Insight**: Impact analysis turns guesswork into science. By understanding exactly what's affected, you can focus regression testing where it matters most.

Not all tests are equally valuable for regression detection. A well-designed regression test suite balances coverage, speed, and maintainability.

**Characteristics of Good Regression Tests**:

| Characteristic | Why It Matters | How to Achieve |
|----------------|----------------|----------------|
| **Deterministic** | Same result every time | No random data, fixed seeds |
| **Fast** | Run frequently | Focused, optimized queries |
| **Independent** | No test order dependencies | Isolated data, no shared state |
| **Resilient** | Not flaky | Robust assertions, retries |
| **Focused** | Test one thing | Single assertion per test |
| **Traceable** | Link to requirements | Clear naming, tags |

