Automated regression testing in CI/CD catches issues early, when they're cheapest to fix. The key is designing a pipeline that provides fast feedback without blocking development.

**Regression Testing Pipeline Stages**:

```
Commit ──▶ Build ──▶ Unit Tests ──▶ Regression Tests ──▶ Deploy
              │            │               │
              ▼            ▼               ▼
         (5 min)      (10 min)        (30 min)
