**Golden Master Testing**:

```javascript
// regression/golden-master.js
class GoldenMaster {
    constructor(testName) {
        this.testName = testName;
        this.masterPath = `./golden-masters/${testName}.json`;
    }

    async capture(response) {
        const master = {
            timestamp: new Date().toISOString(),
            status: response.status,
            headers: this.filterHeaders(response.headers),
            body: response.body,
            schema: this.extractSchema(response.body)
        };

        await fs.writeFile(this.masterPath, JSON.stringify(master, null, 2));
    }

    async verify(response) {
        if (!await this.exists()) {
            // First run - create master
            await this.capture(response);
            return { matched: true, message: 'Golden master created' };
        }

        const master = await this.load();
        const current = {
            status: response.status,
            headers: this.filterHeaders(response.headers),
            body: response.body,
            schema: this.extractSchema(response.body)
        };

        const differences = this.compare(master, current);

        if (differences.length === 0) {
            return { matched: true };
        }

        return {
            matched: false,
            differences,
            master,
            current
        };
    }

    compare(master, current) {
        const differences = [];

        // Compare status
        if (master.status !== current.status) {
            differences.push({
                path: 'status',
                expected: master.status,
                actual: current.status
            });
        }

        // Compare schema
        const schemaDiff = this.deepCompare(master.schema, current.schema, 'schema');
        differences.push(...schemaDiff);

        return differences;
    }

    filterHeaders(headers) {
        // Remove variable headers like date, etag
        const filtered = { ...headers };
        delete filtered.date;
        delete filtered.etag;
        delete filtered['x-request-id'];
        return filtered;
    }
}
```

**Key Insight**: Test data is as important as test code. Treat it with the same care—version it, migrate it, and keep it clean.

Regression tests lose effectiveness over time if not maintained. They become flaky, slow, or miss new regressions.

