Session-based test management (SBTM) provides structure for exploratory testing without losing flexibility. It turns an inherently creative activity into something that can be tracked, measured, and improved over time.

**Session Structure**:

```
┌─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┐
│                    TEST SESSION (60-120 min)                     │
├─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┤
│                                                                   │
│  ┌───────────────┐                                               │
│  │   Charter     │  Mission statement (5 min)                    │
│  └───────┬───────┘                                               │
│          │                                                       │
│          ▼                                                       │
│  ┌───────────────┐                                               │
│  │  Exploration  │  Test execution & discovery (40-90 min)      │
│  │               │  • Follow ideas                               │
│  │               │  • Take notes                                 │
│  │               │  • Log issues                                 │
│  └───────┬───────┘                                               │
│          │                                                       │
│          ▼                                                       │
│  ┌───────────────┐                                               │
│  │   Debrief     │  Review findings (10-15 min)                  │
│  │               │  • What did we learn?                         │
│  │               │  • What issues found?                         │
│  │               │  • What next?                                 │
